    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>1st-level Discipline feature</em></p><p>As a reaction, when you or another creature you can see within 60 feet makes an ability check, attack roll, or saving throw, you can change the value rolled to a 10. This can be declared after the roll, but before failure or success is determined.</p><p>You can use this reaction a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and regain all expended uses upon finishing a long rest.</p>",
